<title>SPAIN: Spain's December jobless falls to 13.82 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's December jobless falls to 13.82 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish Labour Ministry supplied the following figures:</p>
<p>  UNEMPLOYMENT	     DEC 96    NOV 96	DEC 95</p>
<p> Total (million)	   2.22	 2.25	 2.38</p>
<p> Change on month	 -35,240    +16,344    -41,983</p>
<p> Pct of workforce	  13.82	14.04	15.13</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures are based on registered unemployed.  </p>
<p>In 1996, Spain's unemployment fell by 16,859 persons.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
